[h1]Phobos Auto Nav 0.26.0[/h1]
[b]Draft - not published | 2026-09-29[/b]

[h2]Changed[/h2]

[list]
[*]The N2 Polaris Pursuit and N3 Polaris Fire Control boards gain the N1's second-hand routes: lightly worn at the K-Leg fixer, broken at K-Leg supplies and refurbished at the Venus Orbital scrap kiosk, in the usual board lots.
[/list]

[h2]Compatibility and limits[/h2]

[list]
[*]Prices, repair, salvage and saves are unchanged. New offers appear at normal restocks; existing shop inventories are not refilled. See the [url=https://github.com/phobos-dthorga/phobos-ostranauts/blob/main/docs/development/economy-coverage-audit.md]economy coverage audit[/url].
[/list]
